### Create a new report
POST http://localhost:3000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "make": "toyota",
    "model": "corolla",
    "year": 1983,
    "mileage": 100000,
    "lng": 0,
    "lat": 0,
    "price": 500000,
    "approved": false

}

### Approve a report
PATCH http://localhost:3000/reports/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "approved": true
}